This mod is a version of the main mod: "Kobras Smokantes" The idea of the main mod is to make a optimized and fancier version of the vanilla game, Kobras Smokantes VIONT edition is made to be a chaotic game where diplomacy is needed for everyone, players have the choice to take any path they want,  making they have different enemies and allies ( not all nations are working with that idea at the moment ), the game have some economical differences which make the game more dynamical, NO NAVAL CAP.

ATTENTION: this mod wasn't tested in big mp games yet, it may contain late games bugs and maybe economy crashes.
That's a Brazilian mod made by: Jesus Freak and Viont. To bring more fun to our Portuguese speakers community

Playable nations:

Europe: Prussia, England, France, Russia, Sweden, Spain, Netherlands, Austria, Hungary, Sardinia-piedmont, Two-Sicilies and Ottoman Empire.
Asia: Persia, East India Company and Japan.
Africa: Morroco ( Carthage ), Egypt and South Africa
Americas: USA, Canada, Mexico and all south America ( besides Equador, Uruguay and Paraguay ).
total: approximately 25 players

_Nations may be unbalanced_
